# Frontend & CursorSwarm Animation Standards

- **Zero External Dependencies**: Keep all pages (`index.html`, `swarm-demo.html`, `pro1/`–`pro6/`) offline-capable without remote CDN scripts, fonts, or stylesheets. Load vendored `./assets/vendor/cursor-swarm/cursor-swarm.min.js`.
- **Non-Blocking Controls**: Mark floating UI toolbars and debug panels with `data-cs-ignore` so visitors can click "Reveal All", toggle sound, or change speed/palettes at any time.
- **Accessibility**: Keep `respectReducedMotion: true` enabled by default so users with `prefers-reduced-motion: reduce` receive the static page immediately.
- **Browser Proof**: Verify layout, console errors, and `CursorSwarm` lifecycle (`init`, `setSpeed`, `setPalette`, `stop({ reveal: true })`) in headless Chromium after edits.
